# Purpose: Keep local dependencies, outputs, secrets, and VCS data out of builds.
# Input/Output: Docker reads this file before sending the repository build context.
# Invariants: Dependency installation and compilation happen inside the Linux image.
# Debugging: Run `npm run test:docker-context` and inspect `docker build --progress=plain .`.

.git
.github
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
*.log

node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.cache
**/.cache
.npm
tmp
**/tmp
